==Battleground==
*1 [[Dead Donny Dash]] spawns as the boss after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge Back]] spawns.
*3 [[Pigge Back]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Pigge Back]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*4 [[Zomboe]]s spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*3 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Shadow Boxer K]] spawns after 116.67 seconds<sup>3,500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Ring Girl Cat]] is quite helpful here for the Shadow Boxer Ks which are the main threats of this stage. [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]] is able to sneak into Dead Donny Dash's blindspot if timed well and can take it out in one go, depleting the stage's difficulty.

==Trivia==
*The name of this stage contains a typo: Cemetery is misspelled as "Cemetary".

